    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_string_map_entry_storage" kindref="compound">StringMapEntryStorage</ref> - Holds the value in a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_string_map_entry" kindref="compound">StringMapEntry</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Factored out into a separate base class to make it easier to specialize. This is primarily intended to support <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_string_set" kindref="compound">StringSet</ref>, which doesn&apos;t need a value stored at all. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
